  (= (bought goods0) 0)
  (= (bought goods1) 0)
  (= (request goods0) 20)
  (= (request goods1) 23)
Goal: (and (RW:loc truck0 depot0) (>= (bought goods0) (request goods0)) (>= (bought goods1) (request goods1)))
Metric: no-metric
